      </h3>

        <blockquote class="we-truncate we-truncate--multi-line we-truncate--interactive  we-customer-review__body" dir>
        

        <p dir="false" data-test-bidi>Hi, most users (more than 99%) enjoy Yalla for free and they love to have fun with many friends together. Let us work together to develop Yalla to be the best Arab community for our brothers and sisters. If you have any suggestions, you can contact yallasupport@yalla.live and we hope to see your distinguished comment with the five stars. Thank you!</p>
    


