e room\\n6) Lucky gift optimization\\n7) Added new chat hall\\n8) Optimize some functions\\n9) Anniversary theme UI\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-20T01:25:27Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"7.8.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1) Added like function in the room\\n2) Improve Lucky wheel\\n3) Optimization of Smash eggs UI interface\\n4) New games: Monster crush, slots\\n5) Big gift broadcast optimization: support broadcasting outside the room\\n6) Lucky gift optimization\\n7) Added new chat hall\\n8) Optimize some functions\\n9) Anniversary theme UI\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-09-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-09-15T13:03:47Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"7.8.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1) App UI upgrade\\n2) New games online: Rocket  、Horse Racing、Jackpot.\\n3) Dynamic gift icon show up in gift list.\\n4) Banner page optimization.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-08-18\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-08-18T15:11:02Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"7.7.8\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1）Bug fixes and performance improvements\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-07-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-07-28T05:49:35Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"7.7.7\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1）Fix known issues\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-07-09\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-07-09T11:14:20Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"7.7.6\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1) The gift record of the user homepage has been added to give a gift title \\n2) The user homepage has added a guardian \\n3) Ludo and Umo games have added matching to join the game \\n4) The music playback function has been optimized\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-06-15\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-06-15T08:23:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"7.7.4\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1) Videos can be added to the first picture of the personal homepage\\r\\n2) You can upload GIF and MP4 as avatar  in personal information\\r\\n3) Random gift online\\r\\n4) User level optimization and sending gifts can show the experience value of increasing level\\r\\n5) Quality optimization of the Live Stream room\",\"releaseDate\":\"