es\":[\"iphone\",\"ipod\"],\"supportsStreamlinedBuy\":false,\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/sa/app/bobo-group-voice-chat-rooms/id1489566586\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":3,\"ratingCount\":56,\"ratingCountList\":[21,5,4,3,23],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"3.0 stars\"},\"firstVersionSupportingInAppPurchaseApi\":\"1.0\",\"genreDisplayName\":\"Entertainment\",\"name\":\"BoBo - Group Voice Chat Rooms\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"artistName\":\"思伟 邹\",\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":false,\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 12.0 or later.\"},\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires iOS 12.0 or later.\"},\"realityDevice\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Apple Vision\",\"requirementString\":\"Requires visionOS 1.0 or later.\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"BoBo is a global free voice chat app that supports Group voice chat rooms, you can chat and play games with your friends, even share your voice to make new friends.\\nDownload BoBo App and join the most interesting social party!\\n \\nWhy BoBo is the best social app for you?\\n \\nFree voice chat\\nYou can voice chat at any time, anywhere with a mobile data or WIFI, with us, you can meet the one you like.\\n \\nVoice chat rooms\\nChat with new friends all over the world.\\nJoin the most interesting magic social community in the world. Here you can introduce yourself to everyone, singing and sharing your interesting daily, and also make new friends all over the world.\\n \\nVirtual gifts\\nIf you meet someone but you don't know how to express your feelings? Just send a small gift to let him/her notice you.\\n \\nInteresting chat journey\\nBoBo has more than 6 types of rooms, you can find whatever you need\\nEmotional radio station: let you have a friend who will listen to you on the Internet and share your happiness; you will also meet new friends who have common interests with you here.\\nGame/Task room: let you relax and have fun with online games and some interesting task.\\nStill, there are other interesting chat rooms waiting for you to experience.\\n \\nBoBo requests the following permissions:\\nMicrophone: Delivering sound during live broadcast\\nCamera: Take photos and videos\\nAuthorization Request: BoBo needs your permission to obtain storage space that helps you to get a better experience and ensure the normal use of the app\\n \\nCome to join our big family and follow us to get the latest news, updates and also activity in the application. We Appreciate your support, And we will continue to improve and update BoBo to give you the best experience.\\nEmail: dev@chucp.mobi\\n\"},\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"requiredCapabilitiesForRealityDevice\":\"arm64 \",\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.5.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. There are also a series of small updates\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-05-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-05-25T00:47:11Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.5.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. There are also a series of small updates\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-05-24\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-05-24T04:27:49Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.4.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Added the function of binding WhatsApp and upgraded the account security\\n2. A new game, Knife Challenge, is added. Come and play with your friends.\\n3. There are also a series of small updates\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-21\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-21T01:35:16Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.3.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. The lucky pack function has been greatly upgraded, not only can you send coins, but also gifts!\\n2. Newly added room sound effect function, go and give it a try!\\n3. Optimization of basic functions in the room for more convenient.\\n4. There are also a series of small updates.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-12\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-12T02:21:05Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.3.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. The lucky pack function has been greatly upgraded, not only can you send coins, but also gifts!\\n2. Newly added room sound effect function, go and give it a try!\\n3. Optimization of basic functions in the room for more convenient.\\n4. There are also a series of small updates.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-04-08\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-04-08T01:24:37Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.2.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. The Agency has been upgraded, making management more convenient~\\n2. Small upgrade of profile page, come and take a look !\\n3. There are also a series of small improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-03-20\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-03-20T01:45:21Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.1.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. The glory wall of Agency and Hosts now online, come and compete to be on the list!\\n2. The return gift function has been updated, making returning gifts more convenient!\\n3. There are also a series of small improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-02-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-02-28T04:20:01Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. The glory wall of Agency and Hosts now online, come and compete to be on the list!\\n2. The return gift function has been updated, making returning gifts more convenient!\\n3. There are also a series of small improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-02-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-02-26T01:51:25Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.0.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. The title system has been upgraded. Come and collect and light up the titles.\\n2. Super Gifts gives you gift cards. Save the beautiful gift cards and put them on your photo wall!\\n3. Added gameplay gift instructions, giving fun to the gifts try it now\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-02-06\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-02-06T09:15:14Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.0.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. The title system has been upgraded. Come and collect and light up the titles.\\n2. Super Gifts gives you gift cards. Save the beautiful gift cards and put them on your photo wall!\\n3. Added gameplay gift instructions, giving fun to the gifts try it now\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-02-03\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-02-03T04:47:08Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"4.0.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. The title system has been upgraded. Come and collect and light up the titles.\\n2. Super Gifts gives you gift cards. Save the beautiful gift cards and put them on your photo wall!\\n3. Added gameplay gift instructions, giving fun to the gifts try it now\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-01-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-01-29T01:34:55Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.9.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. The relationship cards has been improved, and you can choose a display style aswell\\n2. In addition to some small improvements.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-01-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-01-16T08:43:06Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.8.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. The 1v1PK mode in the room is newly launched, come and enjoy it\\n2. New gift message section has been added to the room.\\n3. New gifts kind are coming ~\\n4. Updated the 2024 titles\\n5. The cumulative recharge rewards have been updated, and the recharge rewards are more generous!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2024-01-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2024-01-02T01:52:15Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.7.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Christmas is coming, come to BOBO to celebrate Christmas, we have updated the decoration with Christmas elements, it is super awesome!\\n2. The super fun new game BoBo Zoo is online, come and win the grand prize!\\n3. The room can parking is available come park your car, so drive your luxury car to the party! You can also earn gold coins.\\n4. Added room records, VIPs can be invisible without being discovered.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-21\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-12-21T01:48:30Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.7.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Christmas is coming, come to BOBO to celebrate Christmas, we have updated the decoration with Christmas elements, it is super awesome!\\n2. The super fun new game BoBo Zoo is online, come and win the grand prize!\\n3. The room can parking is available come park your car, so drive your luxury car to the party! You can also earn gold coins.\\n4. Added room records, VIPs can be invisible without being discovered.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-18\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-12-18T01:43:58Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.6.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Added new room wheat position mode gameplay\\n2. The gift wall and prop wall look better\\n3. Added new combo gift animation\\n4. Added Christmas recharge gift package\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-12-05\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-12-05T06:40:08Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.6.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. Added new room wheat position mode gameplay\\n2. The gift wall and prop wall look better\\n3. Added new combo gift animation\\n4. Added Christmas recharge gift package\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-29\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-11-29T01:19:51Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.5.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. You can now purchase a room number~\\n2. PK can customize the punishment avatar and nickname~\\n3. Added online customer service function\\n4. Added various levels of rewards\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-11-22T01:29:28Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.5.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. You can now purchase a room number~\\n2. PK can customize the punishment avatar and nickname~\\n3. Added online customer service function\\n4. Added various levels of rewards\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-14\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-11-14T01:21:58Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.5.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. You can now purchase a room number~\\n2. PK can customize the punishment avatar and nickname~\\n3. Added online customer service function\\n4. Added various levels of rewards\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-11-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-11-07T01:28:00Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.4.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1.Fixed crash\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-10-28T17:33:45Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.4.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. The family can change its name\\n2. Added new games\\n3. Game currency can be exchanged for goods\\n4. You can report chat information\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-27\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-10-27T12:32:11Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.4.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. The family can change its name\\n2. Added new games\\n3. Game currency can be exchanged for goods\\n4. You can report chat information\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-25\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-10-25T14:07:30Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.4.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1. The family can change its name\\n2. Added new games\\n3. Game currency can be exchanged for goods\\n4. You can report chat information\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-23\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-10-23T01:27:17Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"3.3.3\",\"releaseNotes\":\"1.fix crash\",\"releaseDate\":\"2023-10-08\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2023-10-08T01:43:48Z\"}],\"minimumXROSVersion\":\"1.0\",\"isXROSCompatible\":true,\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1489566586\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=866189017\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"SAR 0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"SAR\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":373726208}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1489566586\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=866189017\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"SAR 0.00\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"SAR\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":373726208}]}],\"requires32bit\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2019-12-05\",\"hasInAppPurchases\":true,\"bundleId\":\"com.duidui.meetyo\",\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"artwork\":{\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple211/v4/65/37/eb/6537eb8c-f722-854b-d288